WEBVTT

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:11.110
Saint Seiya

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.840
Lord of the Underworld, Hades.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.150
What is your business with me?

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.880
Athena.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:19.770
I've come to welcome you.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:37.190
Athena. It was only a dream. Or was it?

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:43.530
It seems the time has come.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:50.350
I was hoping I was just over worried.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.040
The holy war 243 years ago.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:05.140
Athena's seal that contained
the evil has lost its power.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:14.320
The 108 evil stars lead by Hades
will resurrect from the darkness.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:21.440
Another holy battle is about to begin.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:40.730
THE BEGINNING OF A NEW HOLY WAR

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.370
Since when has it been like this?

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:54.540
It was fine two hours ago.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:59.620
Who would dig up a Saint's tomb?

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:04.690
What are you going to do
with a Saint's corpse?

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:05.630
Wait.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:12.640
It looks like this was
busted from the inside.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:14.640
You're right.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:20.370
Then are you saying the corpse
busted out of the grave?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.330
Impossible. A corpse couldn't.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.960
No. There's one who can.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.630
If it's the one who controls death.

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:06.770
In the far distance, a terribly
evil Cosmo has exploded.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:12.190
Could it be?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.570
Stop right there.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:32.890
If you come any closer, I
can't guarantee your life.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:50.410
Mu, you couldn't attack me.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:51.360
What?

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:57.710
Have you forgotten my face?

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:12.840
Could it be? No, it couldn't. You are...

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:20.380
How dare you be so rude, kneel.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:26.500
What's wrong? Can't you hear my orders?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.450
That's right. That's good.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:37.680
You can't disobey me.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.690
Mu, I command you.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:53.420
Bring me Athena's head within twelve hours.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.080
You can do it.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.470
I...

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:02.930
Why are you hesitating?
Hurry, get Athena's head.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:07.980
Even if you order me, that I cannot do.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:17.400
You should know what
it means to disobey him.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.530
That voice.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:32.840
You are...

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.820
Seems like you remember.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.090
You two.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.110
Cancer Deathmask.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:49.060
Pisces Aphrodite.

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.970
Your bodies...

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:58.370
Your spirits have been wandering in limbo.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:03.320
Not in limbo. We have pledged
allegiance with Lord Hades.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:06.060
And have been given new lives.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.830
Hades? Lord of the Underworld.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:19.040
You've exchanged your
lives to be Hades' slaves.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.280
And to come for Athena's life.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:26.280
And you used to Athena's Saints.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.610
Know some shame.

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:29.530
Shut up!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:35.440
You don't understand the terror of the
Underworld indulging in life here.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:49.580
Why do you have the Gold Cloths? No.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:54.590
The darkness of shadows, the
chilly shimmer of the moon.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.540
They're not Gold Cloths.

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:01.290
That's right, these aren't Gold Cloths.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:04.510
Cloths of the Underworld, Surplice.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:10.130
Symbols of Specters, the Underworld
warriors of Lord Hades.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:14.150
Move aside, Mu. There's no use talking.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.210
Do you intend to disobey him?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:29.580
It's true I cannot disobey him.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:34.710
But do you think that means
you guys can do as you please?

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.220
Then we'll have to use force.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.260
Layers of Death!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:56.610
The Layers of Death was blocked.

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:02.080
Wait, what's this?

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.390
Wait, Deathmask.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:16.090
I will demolish Mu's attacks.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.680
The black rose that devours
everything it touches.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.570
Piranhian Rose!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.430
Do you understand?

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:52.550
It's impossible to break the crystal wall.

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.700
Attacking the crystal wall is like

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:01.180
attacking your image in a mirror.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:08.500
The impact will reflect back and hurt you.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:14.360
Haven't you had enough, Mu?

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.330
These two came to be my subordinates.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:24.320
Everything you are doing
is treason towards me.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:30.360
Dismantle the crystal wall.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.180
If you don't, I will.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:40.990
Your attacks won't work on me.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.520
Now, go to the Sanctuary where Athena sleeps.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.280
And get her head.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.150
The road to Pope's chambers,
guarded by the twelve houses.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.250
It's simple to head to the Pope's chambers.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:22.040
Enough, Mu. I said they were my subordinates.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:28.250
Raising your fists at them is
like raising your fist at me.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.330
Will you raise your fist at me, Mu?

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:39.540
Move!

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:46.020
This bastard.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:52.350
Guarding the Aries house
from evil is my duty.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.410
Even if I were to die, I won't let you pass.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.720
Then I'll kill you!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.420
Heh.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.300
Who interrupts?

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:55.190
Seiya.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.190
Mu, what happened?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:06.950
Why are you getting pushed around?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.110
Who are these guys?

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.580
Aphrodite, Deathmask.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:17.490
They died in the battle of
the twelve houses. So why?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:21.210
Is this a dream? Are they ghosts?

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:23.480
They are not ghosts.

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:29.420
They are now warriors of Hades,
Lord of the Underworld, Specters.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.880
Specters? Who is Hades?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.820
The true enemy Athena must defeat.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.710
That is Hades.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:51.570
Between Hades, who tries to rule
the world with darkness and fear.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:57.450
And Athena, who tries to stop him.
There has been a long standing battle.

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:03.210
Now, Athena's seal is broken.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:08.540
Hades is looking to go
against Athena once again.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.590
To stop his ambitions,

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:15.020
Athena and the Saints

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:21.390
have resurrected in this age.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:26.840
I see. So the battles up
to now were just practice.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.140
If you understand, leave.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.060
Eh?

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:36.020
This is no place for a
Bronze Saint like yourself.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.490
Hurry and leave.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.630
What are you saying? I can't
leave. I will fight too.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.470
For Athena.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:51.140
If you disobey, death awaits.
This is the order of Athena.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:56.460
What? Athena, Miss Saori is
kicking us Bronze Saints out?

00:17:56.770 --> 00:17:58.930
And given orders to kill us if we disobey?

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:04.440
Yes, this is Athena's will.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:09.230
That's a lie. We are Athena's Saints.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:18.820
Mu.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:23.660
There must be some mistake.
Let me see Miss Saori, Athena.

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.490
There's some mistake.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.210
There is no mistake.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:41.110
It's a mistake. I won't believe it!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.960
Pest!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:51.160
It's bad enough you interrupted
but now you complain? Enough.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.240
I'm through with you guys.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:10.930
There's no way Miss Saori said that!

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.880
I'll do it.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:32.350
I'll do it! Come, Deathmask!

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:38.330
What's that tattered Cloth? You
should have it repaired by Mu.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:43.320
Do you think you can defeat
me with that tattered Cloth?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:46.550
Defeating you has nothing
to do with my cloth.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.230
Really?

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:01.470
Pegasus Meteor!

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:13.200
Get up, Deathmask. I'll make you
blow bubbles like a real crab.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:20.910
You brat, I'll kick you
down the hole to hell.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:24.600
You're the one who'll go back down the hole.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:28.580
Take this! Layers of Death!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.410
Pegasus Meteor!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:36.870
What?

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.510
Why?

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:46.390
I warned you. If you disobey, death awaits.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.010
No way.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:57.320
Miss Saori.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:06.450
Is it true that you are through with us?

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.240
Why? Why is it?

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.950
It's true. I'll tell you one more thing.

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:38.850
Mu isn't after just the Bronze Saints.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:43.630
He'll offer Athena's life
to Hades too. You get it?

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:49.530
I won't believe what you say.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:53.600
Whether you believe me or not is your choice.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.660
But Mu must carry out orders regardless.

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:02.110
As long as that person is on our side.

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:05.210
That person?

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:09.800
Anyone who goes against
that person cannot remain.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:12.530
In the Sanctuary.

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:21.550
I'll tell you as a parting gift. Listen
carefully, Seiya. His name is...

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:29.060
Don't do anything unnecessary, Deathmask.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:29.440
What?

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:32.620
I will finish Seiya.

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:41.050
Mu.

00:22:42.110 --> 00:22:45.460
Seiya, rest in peace. All right?

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:53.100
It's a lie, Mu.

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:02.560
Starlight Extinction!

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:14.960
Miss Saori!

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:19.330
Seiya.

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:27.640
I thought I heard Seiya's voice.

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:37.660
That's right. I ordered Seiya and the
others not to approach the Sanctuary.

00:23:38.840 --> 00:23:40.570
They shouldn't be near.

00:25:37.320 --> 00:25:39.840
When Aries' quiet anger
cuts across the heavens.

00:25:40.170 --> 00:25:43.530
Mu witnesses the sight of the
great Gold's tainted by evil.

00:25:43.820 --> 00:25:45.720
Saga. Kami. Shura.

00:25:45.900 --> 00:25:50.070
Have you also fallen to Hades
and come to kill Athena?

00:25:50.370 --> 00:25:53.190
The lament of the Saints,
protectors of love and justice,

00:25:53.460 --> 00:25:55.910
echo across the Sanctuary.

00:25:56.390 --> 00:25:58.860
Saint Seiya, "The Three of the Lament."

00:25:59.290 --> 00:26:01.790
Do you sense the Cosmo?
